  "6b31c8cd213712c80eafb01583d5732b8a57dd1fc28ca4bb8765260787f1610a": {
    "url": "assets/audio/library/6b31c8cd213712c80eafb01583d5732b8a57dd1fc28ca4bb8765260787f1610a.mp3",
    "bookId": "demo-carmela",
    "page": 1,
    "duration": 27.789,
    "voice": "Serena",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "每天，山上的风铃都会叮咚叮咚，给农场报平安。今天，卡梅拉竖起耳朵，听见的只有沙沙的树叶声。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 18.453703703703702
      },
      {
        "text": "“风还在，风铃怎么不唱歌了？”",
        "start": 18.712962962962962,
        "duration": 3.481481481481481
      },
      {
        "text": "她望向远处的小山，心里冒出一个大大的问号。",
        "start": 22.453703703703702,
        "duration": 5.3240740740740735
      }
    ],
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "rhythmVersion": "natural-v3",
    "tempo": 1.08,
    "sourceDuration": 31.76,
    "removedSilenceSeconds": 2.32
  },
  "ff7583e6192bfd8a299313001b24ea8753e4a44ef2e6e046e92c76d04957f4c4": {
    "url": "assets/audio/library/ff7583e6192bfd8a299313001b24ea8753e4a44ef2e6e046e92c76d04957f4c4.mp3",
    "bookId": "demo-carmela",
    "page": 2,
    "duration": 43.933,
    "voice": "Serena",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "卡梅拉画了一张小地图，把水壶和绿丝带装进背包。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 4.509259259259259
      },
      {
        "text": "“我去风铃山看看，太阳落山前回来！”她向妈妈挥挥翅膀。",
        "start": 4.768518518518518,
        "duration": 31.203703703703706
      },
      {
        "text": "妈妈笑着替她理好背包带：“遇到困难，记得找朋友一起想办法。”",
        "start": 36.23148148148148,
        "duration": 7.694444444444445
      }
    ],
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "rhythmVersion": "natural-v3",
    "tempo": 1.08,
    "sourceDuration": 53.2,
    "removedSilenceSeconds": 6.32
  },
  "1adfdd35fb0445e2020a67b94e025a7bdf21a7cec582e68cba69cf4031da1998": {
    "url": "assets/audio/library/1adfdd35fb0445e2020a67b94e025a7bdf21a7cec582e68cba69cf4031da1998.mp3",
    "bookId": "demo-carmela",
    "page": 3,
    "duration": 21.178,
    "voice": "Serena",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "走到小溪边，卡梅拉发现地图上的路，被一大片芦苇挡住了。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 8.287037037037036
      },
      {
        "text": "“呱，先别急！”青蛙阿滴跳上石头，“沿着水声走，小木桥就在前面。”",
        "start": 8.546296296296296,
        "duration": 7.259259259259259
      },
      {
        "text": "她把绿丝带系在树枝上，记住回家的方向。",
        "start": 16.064814814814817,
        "duration": 5.111111111111111
      }
    ],
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "rhythmVersion": "natural-v3",
    "tempo": 1.08,
    "sourceDuration": 24.0,
    "removedSilenceSeconds": 1.69
  },
  "44f75dfc1ae14c64d5cc7122f642a631bb2430a9d881ab6356736a972fce44d2": {
    "url": "assets/audio/library/44f75dfc1ae14c64d5cc7122f642a631bb2430a9d881ab6356736a972fce44d2.mp3",
    "bookId": "demo-carmela",
    "page": 4,
    "duration": 20.708,
    "voice": "Serena",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "小桥上，一块木板翘起了头。小兔麦麦抱着胡萝卜，站在桥边发愁。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 9.824074074074073
      },
      {
        "text": "卡梅拉刚想往前跑，又停了下来。",
        "start": 10.083333333333334,
        "duration": 3.175925925925926
      },
      {
        "text": "“冒险不是只顾着赶路。我们先把小桥修好吧！”她说。",
        "start": 13.518518518518517,
        "duration": 7.175925925925926
      }
    ],
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "rhythmVersion": "natural-v3",
    "tempo": 1.08,
    "sourceDuration": 24.0,
    "removedSilenceSeconds": 2.21
  },
  "c17033961c933f55bd7a3969d8cb40718bbd4c919929e690e05924407b50ffa6": {
    "url": "assets/audio/library/c17033961c933f55bd7a3969d8cb40718bbd4c919929e690e05924407b50ffa6.mp3",
    "bookId": "demo-carmela",
    "page": 5,
    "duration": 21.326,
    "voice": "Serena",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "麦麦扶住木板，卡梅拉找来结实的芦苇绳。一个按住，一个绑紧，歪歪的小桥终于不摇了。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 9.777777777777777
      },
      {
        "text": "“一个人真难，两个朋友就有办法！”",
        "start": 10.037037037037036,
        "duration": 4.148148148148148
      },
      {
        "text": "麦麦放好胡萝卜，决定陪卡梅拉一起上山。",
        "start": 14.444444444444443,
        "duration": 6.879629629629629
      }
    ],
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "rhythmVersion": "natural-v3",
    "tempo": 1.08,
    "sourceDuration": 22.48,
    "removedSilenceSeconds": 0.01
  },
  "b8b248c9aa698df526d39303d1e83aa3229e7a808d4b5f7931f4e34c75926c1c": {
    "url": "assets/audio/library/b8b248c9aa698df526d39303d1e83aa3229e7a808d4b5f7931f4e34c75926c1c.mp3",
    "bookId": "demo-carmela",
    "page": 6,
    "duration": 20.815,
    "voice": "Serena",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "到了山顶，她们终于找到了风铃。原来，一根落下的树枝缠住了铃绳，小木锤也掉进了草丛。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 13.194444444444443
      },
      {
        "text": "卡梅拉踮起脚，轻轻解开绳结。",
        "start": 13.453703703703702,
        "duration": 3.175925925925926
      },
      {
        "text": "“别着急，我扶着呢！”麦麦稳稳托住风铃。",
        "start": 16.888888888888886,
        "duration": 3.925925925925926
      }
    ],
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "rhythmVersion": "natural-v3",
    "tempo": 1.08,
    "sourceDuration": 23.04,
    "removedSilenceSeconds": 1.12
  },
  "e3be4052cb36118bb10e83feb056e4d0e5914a3758232c41355a1412ed30e8a4": {
    "url": "assets/audio/library/e3be4052cb36118bb10e83feb056e4d0e5914a3758232c41355a1412ed30e8a4.mp3",
    "bookId": "demo-carmela",
    "page": 7,
    "duration": 23.431,
    "voice": "Serena",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "小木锤找不到了。卡梅拉看见脚边一颗圆圆的松果，忽然有了主意。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 9.953703703703702
      },
      {
        "text": "她把松果系在铃绳上。风一吹，松果碰到木片：叮，咚，叮咚！",
        "start": 10.212962962962962,
        "duration": 7.62037037037037
      },
      {
        "text": "“听！风铃有了新歌声！”两个朋友高兴得转起圈来。",
        "start": 18.09259259259259,
        "duration": 5.333333333333333
      }
    ],
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "rhythmVersion": "natural-v3",
    "tempo": 1.08,
    "sourceDuration": 27.36,
    "removedSilenceSeconds": 2.62
  },
  "10242a59abf3c9d7f21d27221d51f0b98472def47aed4c2675ecdd155bf668c3": {
    "url": "assets/audio/library/10242a59abf3c9d7f21d27221d51f0b98472def47aed4c2675ecdd155bf668c3.mp3",
    "bookId": "demo-carmela",
    "page": 8,
    "duration": 39.491,
    "voice": "Serena",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "夕阳把小路染成了蜂蜜色。卡梅拉回到农场，风铃的歌声一路跟着她。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 12.712962962962962
      },
      {
        "text": "她在地图上画下一座小桥、一颗松果，还有两位新朋友。",
        "start": 12.972222222222221,
        "duration": 5.4074074074074066
      },
      {
        "text": "“明天，会不会又有新发现呢？”卡梅拉合上地图，笑着钻进暖暖的被窝。",
        "start": 18.638888888888886,
        "duration": 20.85185185185185
      }
    ],
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "rhythmVersion": "natural-v3",
    "tempo": 1.08,
    "sourceDuration": 46.4,
    "removedSilenceSeconds": 4.31
  },
  "4cc6b4ff6f02c5db7e1fdae63687d8b5b0d1513b615e1e2c273201998e66a02e": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "小兔妮娅扣好黄色外衣，推开家门。红风筝靠在门边，长尾巴轻轻摆动。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 10.296296296296294
      },
      {
        "text": "“今天，带你看看远处的山。”她把线轴握在掌心。",
        "start": 10.555555555555555,
        "duration": 6.81298611111111
      }
    ],
    "duration": 17.369,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/4cc6b4ff6f02c5db7e1fdae63687d8b5b0d1513b615e1e2c273201998e66a02e.mp3",
    "bookId": "nia-runaway-kite",
    "page": 1
  },
  "29af2621bae0ca7f98df99e4e90f92fdabfa7ba7f01bb29cb05978c39c2d7d2f": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "草叶都朝一个方向弯下腰。妮娅迎着风跑，风筝从花丛上方升了起来。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 11.287037037037036
      },
      {
        "text": "一只绵羊抬头看了好久。妮娅笑着问：“你也想知道云朵后面有什么吗？”",
        "start": 11.546296296296296,
        "duration": 13.842592592592592
      }
    ],
    "duration": 25.397,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/29af2621bae0ca7f98df99e4e90f92fdabfa7ba7f01bb29cb05978c39c2d7d2f.mp3",
    "bookId": "nia-runaway-kite",
    "page": 2
  },
  "d1cf3b262a32e6747a8ea60b02d739d550742ef6a9d6da7caf58c1cd361b003c": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "一阵大风掀起妮娅的围巾。线轴滚过她的手指，骨碌碌落进草里。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 7.564814814814814
      },
      {
        "text": "红风筝却没有停，越过篱笆飞远了。妮娅捡起线轴，顺着天上的红点追去。",
        "start": 7.824074074074073,
        "duration": 9.88750925925926
      }
    ],
    "duration": 17.712,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/d1cf3b262a32e6747a8ea60b02d739d550742ef6a9d6da7caf58c1cd361b003c.mp3",
    "bookId": "nia-runaway-kite",
    "page": 3
  },
  "d37dccae7ab97b8c7455323676b9fda05baf6585c7761d6161d4da80b10905c8": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "小河拦住了去路，水面上的风筝倒影摇摇晃晃。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 5.518518518518518
      },
      {
        "text": "妮娅没有跳进水里。她沿着岸边找到小桥，扶好栏杆，一步一步走到对岸。",
        "start": 5.777777777777778,
        "duration": 18.76359722222222
      }
    ],
    "duration": 24.541,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/d37dccae7ab97b8c7455323676b9fda05baf6585c7761d6161d4da80b10905c8.mp3",
    "bookId": "nia-runaway-kite",
    "page": 4
  },
  "c2c53e58f8e82b3ac0c23880ffe3a354017afae56b5ced772d0a1a8d21a0d3b3": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "山坡很长，妮娅跑得耳朵都软下来了。她停下来，听听风，再走几步。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 10.018518518518517
      },
      {
        "text": "山顶越来越近。原来不用一下子做完，走一点，也是在往前走。",
        "start": 10.277777777777777,
        "duration": 22.51584722222222
      }
    ],
    "duration": 32.794,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/c2c53e58f8e82b3ac0c23880ffe3a354017afae56b5ced772d0a1a8d21a0d3b3.mp3",
    "bookId": "nia-runaway-kite",
    "page": 5
  },
  "f786af3f3dd98819516d02201820361323a73d71fb15e10545be35af8fbffa37": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "山顶的云像一床展开的被子。红尾巴在云边闪了一下，又不见了。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 8.833333333333332
      },
      {
        "text": "妮娅没有着急乱跑。她站稳脚，等风把云推开，终于看清风筝飘向了一棵大树。",
        "start": 9.092592592592592,
        "duration": 8.825532407407408
      }
    ],
    "duration": 17.918,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/f786af3f3dd98819516d02201820361323a73d71fb15e10545be35af8fbffa37.mp3",
    "bookId": "nia-runaway-kite",
    "page": 6
  },
  "86131a738687673b5c65d0897a52ea9800fb70f0885edff8fb193d26b9f3dcfc": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "风筝挂在橡树的低枝上，尾巴缠了一个小结。妮娅轻轻拉线，树叶沙沙响。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 9.833333333333332
      },
      {
        "text": "她松开手，换个方向再试一次。小结慢慢松了，风筝终于回到她怀里。",
        "start": 10.092592592592592,
        "duration": 8.148148148148149
      }
    ],
    "duration": 18.241,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/86131a738687673b5c65d0897a52ea9800fb70f0885edff8fb193d26b9f3dcfc.mp3",
    "bookId": "nia-runaway-kite",
    "page": 7
  },
  "9d1bdf8f000ab3b728c674a55c12177c037d12f89b9a3d0488ac86b7a4321a96": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "山坡另一边，朋友们带来了各种颜色的风筝。妮娅把自己的线轴递过去。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 7.74074074074074
      },
      {
        "text": "“你来试试，我站在你旁边。”天空多了一串笑声，红尾巴也跳起了舞。",
        "start": 8.0,
        "duration": 17.395958333333333
      }
    ],
    "duration": 25.396,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/9d1bdf8f000ab3b728c674a55c12177c037d12f89b9a3d0488ac86b7a4321a96.mp3",
    "bookId": "nia-runaway-kite",
    "page": 8
  },
  "292586cb9823420a5631d8d3034049b43e8994a85dbff2173a8066ef87fd881a": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "风又来了。妮娅把线绕回线轴，握紧后才让风筝升高。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 15.907407407407407
      },
      {
        "text": "她不再只顾着跑，而是一会儿看看天空，一会儿看看朋友。风筝飞得高，大家也站得稳。",
        "start": 16.166666666666668,
        "duration": 8.779625
      }
    ],
    "duration": 24.946,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/292586cb9823420a5631d8d3034049b43e8994a85dbff2173a8066ef87fd881a.mp3",
    "bookId": "nia-runaway-kite",
    "page": 9
  },
  "28245bed803bdbc6321c18f2ba52028a4530debf2abfc26b2af105e4f79b4adc": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "窗外的天空渐渐变暗。妮娅把红风筝挂好，外衣整齐地搭在椅背上。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 9.296296296296294
      },
      {
        "text": "“明天再去旅行吧。”她钻进被窝。长长的红尾巴轻轻晃了一下，像在说晚安。",
        "start": 9.555555555555555,
        "duration": 14.94127777777778
      }
    ],
    "duration": 24.497,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/28245bed803bdbc6321c18f2ba52028a4530debf2abfc26b2af105e4f79b4adc.mp3",
    "bookId": "nia-runaway-kite",
    "page": 10
  },
  "15301c5df40d4396b3a2c04b1b87e83ceb193cfcfdbda25e5ae224c86fde41ea": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "小海龟芬恩住在一片彩色珊瑚旁。每天晚上，一条灯笼鱼会点亮回家的路。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 8.351851851851851
      },
      {
        "text": "今天，小灯却暗了下来。“别担心，”芬恩说，“我们一起找找光去了哪里。”",
        "start": 8.61111111111111,
        "duration": 10.156347222222223
      }
    ],
    "duration": 18.767,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/15301c5df40d4396b3a2c04b1b87e83ceb193cfcfdbda25e5ae224c86fde41ea.mp3",
    "bookId": "fin-glowing-sea",
    "page": 1
  },
  "b3e6f3d217c37274adb3fc43e62c586cfd8d1c45a8022a5b216bc81f2c2ec047": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "芬恩带上一只空瓶，慢慢向下游。海面变成头顶一块晃动的蓝玻璃。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 8.592592592592592
      },
      {
        "text": "他回头看看朋友，又摆摆鳍。前面还很陌生，不过他愿意先游一小段。",
        "start": 8.851851851851851,
        "duration": 11.441106481481484
      }
    ],
    "duration": 20.293,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/b3e6f3d217c37274adb3fc43e62c586cfd8d1c45a8022a5b216bc81f2c2ec047.mp3",
    "bookId": "fin-glowing-sea",
    "page": 2
  },
  "0e331ae9f3ef3f465c96ea929978bc0f59f353a9696db89bdb5d3392fd30fe7c": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "长长的海带挡在前面，像一排柔软的门帘。芬恩没有用力挤。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 7.231481481481481
      },
      {
        "text": "他等海流经过，顺着海带之间的空隙穿了过去。空瓶碰到叶尖，发出轻轻的一声响。",
        "start": 7.4907407407407405,
        "duration": 22.979800925925925
      }
    ],
    "duration": 30.471,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/0e331ae9f3ef3f465c96ea929978bc0f59f353a9696db89bdb5d3392fd30fe7c.mp3",
    "bookId": "fin-glowing-sea",
    "page": 3
  },
  "2e69350a150af953ef05a4952c7e3b14c5aeec3c88e19aec8a35616c2f8921ce": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "一只小螃蟹正在沙地上画弯弯曲曲的线。芬恩停下来问路。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 5.75
      },
      {
        "text": "螃蟹举起钳子，指向更深的蓝色：“我见过亮亮的小点，不过你要慢一点找。”",
        "start": 6.009259259259259,
        "duration": 13.657407407407407
      }
    ],
    "duration": 19.68,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/2e69350a150af953ef05a4952c7e3b14c5aeec3c88e19aec8a35616c2f8921ce.mp3",
    "bookId": "fin-glowing-sea",
    "page": 4
  },
  "1e2c093237a3645db6ec53191e0d0db7bab204347a64d5ddcd97102fcd9ab52d": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "越往下，海水越安静。芬恩有一点害怕，就轻轻数着自己的呼吸。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 10.38888888888889
      },
      {
        "text": "一只水母亮起淡紫色的光。原来，看不清的地方，也有温柔的邻居。",
        "start": 10.648148148148147,
        "duration": 9.342592592592592
      }
    ],
    "duration": 19.992,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/1e2c093237a3645db6ec53191e0d0db7bab204347a64d5ddcd97102fcd9ab52d.mp3",
    "bookId": "fin-glowing-sea",
    "page": 5
  },
  "7471572afc347ca020c574402fe06c010a57dd6a7e898001d3388c61e5905fc9": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "一条旧木船躺在海底，舷窗像圆圆的眼睛。芬恩在外面绕了一圈，没有钻进黑洞。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 12.11111111111111
      },
      {
        "text": "瓶子映出一点蓝光，原来是船旁的小生物正闪闪发亮。他把这个发现记在心里。",
        "start": 12.370370370370368,
        "duration": 10.576754629629631
      }
    ],
    "duration": 22.947,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/7471572afc347ca020c574402fe06c010a57dd6a7e898001d3388c61e5905fc9.mp3",
    "bookId": "fin-glowing-sea",
    "page": 6
  },
  "1c9dc89996dd78472b0c7e976300e0d727fe3139d94b822289c936a98ca2cb8d": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "低低的歌声从身后传来。一头鲸鱼缓缓游过，巨大的影子遮住了沙地。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 11.444444444444443
      },
      {
        "text": "芬恩挥挥鳍，鲸鱼也轻轻摆尾。水流把一群闪光的小点送到他面前。",
        "start": 11.703703703703704,
        "duration": 9.110379629629628
      }
    ],
    "duration": 20.814,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/1c9dc89996dd78472b0c7e976300e0d727fe3139d94b822289c936a98ca2cb8d.mp3",
    "bookId": "fin-glowing-sea",
    "page": 7
  },
  "b588854f937d71ebcc85c0da5a1545460c9a7d84ec57ddd04cc05122c9d8a9ab": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "闪光的小点聚在一起，像一条会游动的星河。芬恩把空瓶举起来，瓶壁也映出了光。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 12.444444444444443
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有把小生命关起来，只借着这片亮光，认清了回家的方向。",
        "start": 12.703703703703704,
        "duration": 7.781462962962964
      }
    ],
    "duration": 20.485,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/b588854f937d71ebcc85c0da5a1545460c9a7d84ec57ddd04cc05122c9d8a9ab.mp3",
    "bookId": "fin-glowing-sea",
    "page": 8
  },
  "0edd50f9d0062a4effd039c79f5290294063f06a9e5068a5947f59e94db5eec3": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "回到珊瑚旁，芬恩把一路上的发现告诉大家。小鱼、水母和珊瑚都轻轻闪起了光。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 9.555555555555555
      },
      {
        "text": "灯笼鱼抬起头，也重新亮了起来。好多小小的光在一起，足够照见每一位朋友。",
        "start": 9.814814814814813,
        "duration": 12.255810185185187
      }
    ],
    "duration": 22.071,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/0edd50f9d0062a4effd039c79f5290294063f06a9e5068a5947f59e94db5eec3.mp3",
    "bookId": "fin-glowing-sea",
    "page": 9
  },
  "43ab3e78a04f9f0308b1ab6d61b654aa8e9056c1b25ad74c6587a6133b84e3c0": {
    "voice": "Serena",
    "engine": "Qwen3-TTS-1.7B-4bit",
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "芬恩在珊瑚边躺下来，空瓶安静地放在身旁。水母游过，留下柔柔的亮。",
        "start": 0.0,
        "duration": 11.166666666666666
      },
      {
        "text": "他闭上眼睛。今天走了很远，明天还可以和朋友一起，发现更多小小的光。",
        "start": 11.425925925925926,
        "duration": 17.663574074074077
      }
    ],
    "duration": 29.09,
    "url": "assets/audio/library/43ab3e78a04f9f0308b1ab6d61b654aa8e9056c1b25ad74c6587a6133b84e3c0.mp3",
    "bookId": "fin-glowing-sea",
    "page": 10
  }
}
